### 2. Performance Analysis
- **Time Complexity:**
  - Matrix initialization and copying operations run in O(N^2) for N x N matrices.
  - The LU factorization process involves nested loops that result in a time complexity of O(N^3).
  - Solving the linear system has a complexity of O(N^2) due to forward and backward substitution.

- **Space Complexity:**
